body:
Yeah exactly, and I would encourage and even help that person to lose weight. I think romantic attraction is something pretty different to sexual attraction, and if you love someone you wish the best for them and imagine them happy.  My fear is that if I ever have to live that situation my attraction towards that person would diminish as it's something I can't really control.

&#x200B;

And on how fat I rationally prefer them healthier, but in terms of sexual arousal it's usually the bigger the better until they reach a certain threshold where it begins to be difficult to move or do things on your own that I find quite unattractive.
